{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261026/photo/bkn-20261026094015357-1026_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261026094417\"/><p>天文台預測今日大致天晴。</p><p>東北季候風正為廣東沿岸帶來大致晴朗的天氣。今日(26日)上午9時天文台錄得氣溫攝氏27度，相對濕度百分之60。過去一小時，京士柏錄得的平均紫外線指數是1，強度屬於低。</p><p>天文台預測今日大致天晴。日間市區最高氣溫約攝氏30度，新界再高一兩度。吹和緩東至東北風。展望未來一兩日風勢較大，部分時間有陽光。本周後期天晴，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:38.096771+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:40:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:08.512763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:42.777751+00:00","content_hash":"770af4acde82e01e5f912bac44ec8efee2bdbfd64282e11b899786d3f8730ec5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:38.096771+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}